  "title": "10-Bean Soup",
  "description": "One pound of mixed beans soaked overnight is covered in water with onions, celery, and garlic sautéed with bacon in this hearty 10-bean soup recipe.",
  "authors": [
    "Laurie Brantley"
  ],
